==English==

===Etymology===
Derived from '''QB1''' ("[[cue]] [[bee]] [[one]]"), short for '''[[w:(15760) 1992 QB1|(15760) 1992 QB1]]''', the first such object discovered

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˌkjuː.biːˈwʌn.oʊ/|lang=en}} (that is, "QB1-o")
<!-- but there are other pronunciations of [[one]] -->

===Noun===
